Introduction
============

If you are new to the Gfarm file system, we recommend that you read
the documents in the following order:

1. Overview
  Please read OVERVIEW.en.
2. How to install Gfarm file system
  If you intend to install Gfarm from the source code, please read
  INSTALL-manual-en.md.
  If you intend to install Gfarm from the RPM binary package, please read
  INSTALL.RPM.en.
  If you intend to install Gfarm from the Debian binary package, please read
  INSTALL.Debian.en.
3. How to set up Gfarm file system
  Please read SETUP-manual-en.md.
4. How to use Gfarm file system
  If you intend to mount Gfarm file system by gfarm2fs, please read the
  documents in the gfarm2fs package.

List of Documents
=================

In the source tree, SETUP.private.*, KNOWN_PROBLEMS.* and Gfarm-FAQ.*
are in the doc directory.

- README.en (in English)
  README.ja (in Japanese)
	This file.

- LICENSE (in English)
	The License for Gfarm.

- RELNOTES (in English)
	This document describes the differences in each version.

- OVERVIEW.en (in English)
  OVERVIEW.ja (in Japanese)
	This document introduces an overview of Gfarm and its terminology.

- INSTALL-manual-en.md (in English)
  INSTALL-manual-ja.md (in Japanese)
	This document describes the step-by-step procedure to install
	Gfarm and related software, such as cyrus-sasl-xoauth2-idp,
	gfarm2fs and jwt-agent, from the source code on Rocky Linux and
	Ubuntu, including the OS settings and the test of the installation.

- INSTALL.en (in English)
  INSTALL.ja (in Japanese)
	This document is a reference to build Gfarm from the source code.
	It describes the options of configure, and the packages required
	for each feature on RPM-based and Debian-based distributions.

- INSTALL.RPM.en (in English)
  INSTALL.RPM.ja (in Japanese)
	This document describes how to install Gfarm from the RPM binary
	packages that are used in Red Hat Enterprise Linux and its
	derivatives (e.g. Rocky Linux and AlmaLinux), Fedora, openSUSE, etc.

- INSTALL.Debian.en (in English)
  INSTALL.Debian.ja (in Japanese)
	This document describes how to install Gfarm from the Debian binary
	packages that are used in Debian and Ubuntu.

- SETUP-manual-en.md (in English)
  SETUP-manual-ja.md (in Japanese)
	This document describes how to set up a Gfarm file system.

- SETUP.private.en (in English)
  SETUP.private.ja (in Japanese)
	This document describes how to set up a private Gfarm file
	system as a non-privileged user, without the root privilege.
	Note that only that user can use Gfarm in this case, thus
	SETUP-manual-en.md / SETUP-manual-ja.md is usually recommended.

- KNOWN_PROBLEMS.en (in English)
  KNOWN_PROBLEMS.ja (in Japanese)
	This document describes known problems with Gfarm.

- Gfarm-FAQ.en (in English)
  Gfarm-FAQ.ja (in Japanese)
	This document describes frequently asked questions and answers.

- Reference manual in both HTML and UNIX manpage format.
  (both English and Japanese)

- User's manual in HTML format. (both English and Japanese)

Please see https://oss-tsukuba.org/en/gfarm as well.
